{"id":"5a6025ef2eacbac3","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-normal-filter.md","title":"ZFC Normal Filter","display":"df-zfc-normal-filter — ZFC Normal Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-normal-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-normal-filter","58-df-zfc-filter-normal-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-normal-filter — ZFC Normal Filter","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-filter-complete-filter.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-normal-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-normal-filter</span><span>58-df-zfc-filter-normal-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-normal-filter — ZFC Normal Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6d423b981f2223af\" href=\"?note=6d423b981f2223af\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-filter-complete-filter.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-filter-complete-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega&lt;\\kappa\">\\(\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\kappa)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFilterCompleteFilter}_S(F,\\kappa,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFilterCompleteFilter}_S(F,\\kappa,\\kappa)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6d423b981f2223af\" href=\"?note=6d423b981f2223af\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-filter-complete-filter.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-filter-complete-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcFilterNormalFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcFilterNormalFilter}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (predicates defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S(F,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterNormalFilter}_S(F,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{NormalFilter}_S(F,\\kappa)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterNormalFilter}_S(F,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterNormalFilter}_S(F,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterCompleteFilter}_S(F,\\kappa,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\langle A_\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\rangle\\in F^\\kappa\\;\n\\left(\n\\{\\xi&lt;\\kappa:\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\xi\\;(\\xi\\in A_\\alpha)\\}\\in F\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}normal\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFilterNormalFilter}_S(F,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\n\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcFilterCompleteFilter}_S(F,\\kappa,\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\langle A_\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\rangle\\in F^\\kappa\\;\n\\left(\n\\{\\xi&lt;\\kappa:\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\xi\\;(\\xi\\in A_\\alpha)\\}\\in F\n\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The defining closure is closure under diagonal intersections.</li>\n<li>The former regressive-function conjunct incorrectly demanded a measure-one\nfiber for every normal filter; that stronger conclusion generally requires\nan ultrafilter. The corresponding filter formulation only guarantees an\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span>-positive fiber.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-filter-normal-filter</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-filter-complete-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"6d423b981f2223af","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"